      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:41/seg:0",
      "source": "The declarator for the ``None`` type is a zero-width space.",
      "source_hash": 18037948464687139380,
      "context_hash": 10544335042767477406,
      "translation": "``None`` 타입의 선언자는 폭이 0인 공백입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:42/seg:0",
      "source": "These characters should be obvious and easy to remember and type for every programmer.",
      "source_hash": 7751106520999271922,
      "context_hash": 12183140538755709413,
      "translation": "이러한 문자는 모든 프로그래머가 분명하게 이해하고 기억하며 입력하기 쉬워야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Unicode replacement units",
      "source_hash": 2191581164642056769,
      "context_hash": 6472955094082090723,
      "translation": "유니코드 대체 단위",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Since even in our modern, globalized world there are still some old-fashioned rebels who can't or don't want to use Unicode in their source code, and since Python is a forgiving language, a fallback is provided for those:",
      "source_hash": 4690028096902144031,
      "context_hash": 3541418552999851480,
      "translation": "현대의 세계화된 세상에서도 소스 코드에서 유니코드를 사용할 수 없거나 사용하기를 원하지 않는 구식 반항자들이 여전히 존재하고, Python은 관대한 언어이므로 그러한 사람들을 위한 대체 수단이 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Instead of the single Unicode character, they can type ``name${UNICODE NAME OF THE DECLARATOR}$``.",
      "source_hash": 17856211597184602535,
      "context_hash": 15901118471732278336,
      "translation": "단일 유니코드 문자 대신 ``name${UNICODE NAME OF THE DECLARATOR}$``\\ 를 입력할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, these two function definitions are equivalent",
      "source_hash": 16133447029770864828,
      "context_hash": 14119607211028240227,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 다음 두 함수 정의는 서로 동등합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "and",
      "source_hash": 4292429818594793634,
      "context_hash": 1095923436053311914,
      "translation": "그리고",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "This is still easy to read and makes the full power of type-annotated Python available to ASCII believers.",
      "source_hash": 4131028172049527707,
      "context_hash": 14639344010489650181,
      "translation": "이는 여전히 읽기 쉬우며 ASCII를 신봉하는 사람들도 타입 어노테이션이 적용된 Python의 모든 기능을 사용할 수 있게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:36:08.672251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The ``typedef`` statement",
      "source_hash": 13834887197383348144,
      "context_hash": 3988717279870012126,
      "translation": "``typedef`` 문",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The mapping between types and declarators can be extended with this new statement.",
      "source_hash": 10841238467316846882,
      "context_hash": 2650985384026698762,
      "translation": "타입과 선언자 간의 매핑은 이 새로운 문으로 확장할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366760Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The syntax is as follows",
      "source_hash": 9145368188258610243,
      "context_hash": 15547354889610361374,
      "translation": "구문은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366762Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "where ``expr`` resolves to a type object.",
      "source_hash": 2667037115038036258,
      "context_hash": 12993066395780636384,
      "translation": "여기서 ``expr``\\ 은 타입 객체로 해석됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366762Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "For convenience, the ``typedef`` statement can also be mixed with the ``class`` statement for new classes, like so",
      "source_hash": 14735162825401178390,
      "context_hash": 4339624524740263041,
      "translation": "편의를 위해 새로운 클래스에 대해서는 ``typedef`` 문을 ``class`` 문과 다음과 같이 함께 사용할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366763Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 6089236771480885452,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366763Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This is the standard ``os.path.normpath`` function, converted to type declaration syntax",
      "source_hash": 3811674348292623559,
      "context_hash": 2993249176167992976,
      "translation": "이것은 표준 ``os.path.normpath`` 함수를 타입 선언 구문으로 변환한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366764Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "As you can clearly see, the type declarations add expressiveness, while at the same time they make the code look much more professional.",
      "source_hash": 9228028826624077760,
      "context_hash": 786823267267129066,
      "translation": "명확히 알 수 있듯이, 타입 선언은 표현력을 높이는 동시에 코드를 훨씬 더 전문적으로 보이게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366764Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Compatibility issues",
      "source_hash": 1938313563152061382,
      "context_hash": 3838063395326368566,
      "translation": "호환성 문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366764Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To enable type declaration mode, one has to write",
      "source_hash": 10357674541828545944,
      "context_hash": 8947265879258403359,
      "translation": "타입 선언 모드를 활성화하려면 다음을 작성해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366765Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "which enables Unicode parsing of the source [#]_, makes ``typedef`` a keyword and enforces correct types for all assignments and function calls.",
      "source_hash": 12462213895201125082,
      "context_hash": 13757018118130944868,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 소스의 유니코드 구문 분석이 활성화되고 [#]_, ``typedef``\\ 가 키워드가 되며 모든 할당과 함수 호출에 올바른 타입이 적용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366765Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rejection",
      "source_hash": 6287573799111272283,
      "context_hash": 8817118647698177209,
      "translation": "거부",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "After careful considering, much soul-searching, gnashing of teeth and rending of garments, it has been decided to reject this PEP.",
      "source_hash": 12854866468373336592,
      "context_hash": 17453970729751972903,
      "translation": "신중한 검토와 깊은 고민, 이를 악물고 괴로워하는 과정과 옷을 찢는 심사숙고 끝에 이 PEP를 거부하기로 결정했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "References",
      "source_hash": 17861670083855418992,
      "context_hash": 11666962887813450348,
      "translation": "참고 자료",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "https://mail.python.org/pipermail/python-list/2003-June/210588.html",
      "source_hash": 17835223406526016669,
      "context_hash": 518308013157035466,
      "translation": "https://mail.python.org/pipermail/python-list/2003-June/210588.html",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "https://mail.python.org/pipermail/python-list/2000-May/034685.html",
      "source_hash": 7921762353220127025,
      "context_hash": 13343684270063453474,
      "translation": "https://mail.python.org/pipermail/python-list/2000-May/034685.html",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "http://groups.google.com/group/comp.lang.python/browse_frm/thread/6ae8c6add913635a/de40d4ffe9bd4304?lnk=gst&q=type+declarations&rnum=6",
      "source_hash": 9774866111819053328,
      "context_hash": 16657287267086435371,
      "translation": "http://groups.google.com/group/comp.lang.python/browse_frm/thread/6ae8c6add913635a/de40d4ffe9bd4304?lnk=gst&q=type+declarations&rnum=6",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Though, if you know the language in question, it may not be *that* unrelated.",
      "source_hash": 8097181299960058440,
      "context_hash": 14447450870133056434,
      "translation": "다만 해당 언어를 알고 있다면 *that*\\ 과 그다지 관련이 없지는 않을 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Well, it would, if there was a Perl 6.",
      "source_hash": 5352295506221193237,
      "context_hash": 11227371286015644322,
      "translation": "글쎄요, Perl 6이 존재한다면 그랬을 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Since the name ``TypeError`` is already in use, this name has been chosen",
      "source_hash": 5569322278374331386,
      "context_hash": 13326626316025167149,
      "translation": "``TypeError``\\ 라는 이름이 이미 사용 중이므로 이 이름을 선택했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "for obvious reasons.",
      "source_hash": 14703763049103733345,
      "context_hash": 5602970906046747760,
      "translation": "명백한 이유 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The encoding in which the code is written is read from a standard coding",
      "source_hash": 925452652336686232,
      "context_hash": 6566794350448942665,
      "translation": "코드가 작성된 인코딩은 표준 코딩 쿠키에서 읽습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "cookie.",
      "source_hash": 12686775107134553969,
      "context_hash": 12847150924695131552,
      "translation": "표준 코딩 쿠키입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "There will also be an autodetection mechanism, invoked by ``from __future__ import encoding_hell``.",
      "source_hash": 10972151122920328789,
      "context_hash": 12197522300802797581,
      "translation": "``from __future__ import encoding_hell``\\ 에서 호출되는 자동 감지 메커니즘도 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366770Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Acknowledgements",
      "source_hash": 16326275492144793040,
      "context_hash": 6745379632441185253,
      "translation": "감사의 말",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366770Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Many thanks go to Armin Ronacher, Alexander Schremmer and Marek Kubica who helped find the most suitable and mnemonic declarator for built-in types.",
      "source_hash": 1490592246166705077,
      "context_hash": 7971580314115960710,
      "translation": "내장 타입에 가장 적합하고 기억하기 쉬운 선언자를 찾는 데 도움을 주신 Armin Ronacher, Alexander Schremmer 및 Marek Kubica에게 진심으로 감사드립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:25:03.366770Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:2/seg:0",
